              "An API node requires class_type.",
              "API class_type must be a nonempty string.",
              "An API node requires inputs.",
              "API inputs must be an object.",
              "Optional API metadata should be an object.",
              "A reference-shaped value has no confirmable source; a connection is not established.",
              "A value naming an existing source has an invalid or missing output index.",
              "A reference-shaped value has an unconfirmed source and invalid index; interpretation remains unchecked.",
              "The input file was not found.",
              "The input could not be verified as a readable regular file.",
              "UNC input paths are not accepted.",
              "Device input paths are not accepted.",
              "Links and reparse points are not accepted.",
              "The input exceeds the byte limit.",
