              "An internal error prevented processing.",
              "No supported save format was identified.",
              "Conflicting save-format features prevent selection.",
              "The format version is missing its required numeric value.",
              "The legacy version differs from the expected value.",
              "A required top-level field is absent.",
              "A top-level field or root has an invalid type.",
              "The node count exceeds the configured limit.",
              "The link count exceeds the configured limit.",
              "A node identifier has an invalid type.",
              "A node identifier occurs more than once.",
              "A required node field is absent.",
              "A node or node field has an invalid type.",
              "A link record or field has an invalid shape or type.",
              "A required link field is absent.",
              "A link identifier is not a finite number.",
              "A link identifier occurs more than once.",
